1
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:05,500
Come tears or laughs, this 
is the end of it all!

2
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:08,380
Let's cap off our training 
camp with a big victory, guys!

3
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,580
Yeah!

4
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:14,170
Okay, this is it. Let's throw 
everything we have at 'em!

5
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:15,500
Huh?

6
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:17,670
You really are just a one-trick pony!

7
00:00:17,830 --> 00:00:21,250
And let me tell you,
I know plenty of ways to deal with those!

8
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:23,000
Corner to corner...

9
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:26,920
They're doing an...

10
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,960
...overload formation!

11
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:35,750
Watch the other side! Adjust your positions!

12
00:00:41,790 --> 00:00:43,500
Trying to get me with another fake?!

13
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:56,000
Defensive foul on #4! Basket 
counts! One free-throw!

14
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:05,630
That's not enough... for 
you to beat our team.

15
00:01:07,750 --> 00:01:09,710
Dammit! Don't fuck with me!

16
00:01:17,380 --> 00:01:20,080
The day that you quit playing basketball...

17
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:23,500
Do you remember what it 
is you said to me, Senpai?

18
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:24,960
Huh?

19
00:01:27,330 --> 00:01:31,250
Back then... you lied straight to my face...

20
00:01:31,710 --> 00:01:33,960
...and I have never forgiven you for it.

21
00:01:39,290 --> 00:01:47,130
Kagami ni senaka mukete ayumu 
hodo ni toozakaru yume yo

22
00:01:47,290 --> 00:01:51,630
Massugu kimi to mukiaitai

23
00:01:51,960 --> 00:01:58,250
Dekinai jibun e to "never mind"

24
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:06,170
Ahiru no Sora

25
00:02:07,710 --> 00:02:12,080
Nagare sagyou de waketeyuku yume

26
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:15,380
Muki? Fumuki? Iwaba rongai?

27
00:02:15,460 --> 00:02:19,790
Koe mo naku kietetta koe

28
00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:22,790
Tameiki sura denai

29
00:02:23,170 --> 00:02:29,000
Hito no sei ni shitatte owarenai

30
00:02:29,170 --> 00:02:32,960
Me no mae ni kiritatta ima

31
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:37,000
"Koetai" to kokoro ga sakenderu

32
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:44,540
Dekinai wake o sagasu nara daredemo dekiru sa

33
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:52,080
Agaki hashitta sono saki 
mada shiranai jibun to deau

34
00:02:52,380 --> 00:02:58,460
Kabe ni kizamikonda rakugaki to "never mind"

35
00:02:58,630 --> 00:03:02,540
Ima asu e to hazume

36
00:03:09,670 --> 00:03:13,790
Higher Than Anyone

37
00:03:16,460 --> 00:03:19,080
Sweet! He made the free-throw, too!

38
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:20,290
Way to go, Konishi!

39
00:03:20,290 --> 00:03:22,460
Keep it up! Keep it up!

40
00:03:20,290 --> 00:03:23,750
Kuzuryu
Kitasumiyoshi

41
00:03:21,250 --> 00:03:24,540
Kitasumi! Kitasumi! Kitasumi!

42
00:03:24,540 --> 00:03:26,000
Wait just a damn second!

43
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,880
What the hell do you mean I "lied" to you?!

44
00:03:27,880 --> 00:03:29,250
Cut it out, Momoharu.

45
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:31,250
We're in the middle of a game.

46
00:03:35,540 --> 00:03:37,250
If they score, then we score right back!

47
00:03:37,630 --> 00:03:39,380
Make sure you keep the ball moving!

48
00:03:41,290 --> 00:03:42,580
Senpai...

49
00:03:44,790 --> 00:03:46,080
Hey! Konishi!

50
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,790
What the heck was that?

51
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,830
You played junior basketball, 
so you should know better!

52
00:03:51,670 --> 00:03:54,210
Seriously, don't screw up our 2-man drills.

53
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,790
I'm sorry!

54
00:03:55,790 --> 00:03:56,710
Whatever.

55
00:03:56,710 --> 00:03:58,420
Go practice the basics 
with the other newbies.

56
00:03:58,420 --> 00:04:00,630
Uh, okay! Sorry again!

57
00:04:08,420 --> 00:04:11,710
Momoharu! Dude! You should at least be able
to do layups by now!

58
00:04:11,710 --> 00:04:14,000
You're making us look bad 
in front of the new guys!

59
00:04:14,540 --> 00:04:16,670
Huh? Who cares about that crap?!

60
00:04:17,540 --> 00:04:19,250
There ain't nothing wrong with being sucky!

61
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:21,960
I'm still just learning the steps, you know!

62
00:04:22,210 --> 00:04:25,830
I think you mean "learning the ropes," dude.
You're so stupid.

63
00:04:25,830 --> 00:04:29,790
Everybody knows what I mean!
And stop snacking on shit during practice, dammit!

64
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:33,000
That guy is a riot! I've 
never had a Senpai like him!

65
00:04:33,210 --> 00:04:36,250
"There's nothing wrong 
with being sucky," really?

66
00:04:36,250 --> 00:04:37,750
He's so cool...

67
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,290
Thanks for the practice session!

68
00:04:40,460 --> 00:04:41,960
Make sure everything gets locked up!

69
00:04:41,960 --> 00:04:43,630
Freshmen, you're all on mop duty!

70
00:04:44,790 --> 00:04:47,670
Oh, hey. Don't bother putting the board away.

71
00:04:47,880 --> 00:04:48,830
Huh?

72
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:50,130
Because I'm gonna use it.

73
00:04:50,330 --> 00:04:53,210
U-use it? But team practice 
is over for today...

74
00:04:53,210 --> 00:04:56,130
Shut your face, dummy. 
Hurry and go home already.

75
00:04:56,130 --> 00:04:57,380
Uh, okay...

76
00:04:57,380 --> 00:05:00,500
Everybody makes him stay and work overtime.
That's how bad he sucks.

77
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:02,540
I practice late cuz I WANT to!

78
00:05:02,830 --> 00:05:07,630
Um, then... would it be okay if I joined you?

79
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:08,960
Huh?

80
00:05:08,960 --> 00:05:12,080
Sure, but only if you fetch me
a yakisoba sandwich. And pay for it.

81
00:05:12,380 --> 00:05:14,380
O-okay! Right away!

82
00:05:14,380 --> 00:05:15,040
Dude!

83
00:05:27,170 --> 00:05:29,330
Jeez, you're outta shape.

84
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,040
I'm sorry...!

85
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:37,170
We run so much during team practice already...
but you still do this extra stuff every day?

86
00:05:37,670 --> 00:05:41,920
Is basketball really a sport...
that requires all of this effort to play?

87
00:05:42,250 --> 00:05:44,000
If you want to get good, yeah.

88
00:05:44,380 --> 00:05:46,630
But it'll take even more 
than this to get there.

89
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:51,380
If I put in more effort... do you think
I could become good, too?

90
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:53,420
Hell if I know, man.

91
00:05:53,420 --> 00:05:55,170
Looking at you now, I'd say no.

92
00:06:07,790 --> 00:06:09,630
You feelin' okay, Konitan?

93
00:06:11,460 --> 00:06:13,920
Man, you look as stable on 
your feet as a baby deer.

94
00:06:14,170 --> 00:06:18,210
U-um... my house is over this 
way, so please excuse me.

95
00:06:18,210 --> 00:06:19,920
Sure. Bye-bye.

96
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,210
G-goodbye.

97
00:06:22,210 --> 00:06:23,040
Hey!

98
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:24,830
Ah, yes?

99
00:06:27,710 --> 00:06:29,330
See ya tomorrow, dude!

100
00:06:31,210 --> 00:06:32,250
Okay.

101
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:39,040
When did I ever lie? I've 
had enough of your bullshit!

102
00:06:40,540 --> 00:06:44,460
You know that I hate lying,
and I hate being lied to even more!

103
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,170
He ignored my sign!

104
00:06:46,540 --> 00:06:48,210
Go to the outside, Momoharu!

105
00:06:48,790 --> 00:06:49,880
Momoharu?!

106
00:06:58,580 --> 00:06:59,920
Nice block!

107
00:06:59,920 --> 00:07:01,880
Konishi's totally got the 
advantage on that guy!

108
00:07:03,290 --> 00:07:04,420
Sweet! We got the ball!

109
00:07:04,420 --> 00:07:06,790
We've totally stolen all the 
momentum from Kuzu High!

110
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:10,250
That was a totally reckless move, Captain!
You should have jus-

111
00:07:10,250 --> 00:07:11,290
Shut up!

112
00:07:13,330 --> 00:07:15,210
They're gonna come at us from one side again!

113
00:07:15,580 --> 00:07:17,540
Look out for any moves in low-post!

114
00:07:20,170 --> 00:07:22,750
Senpai, have you really forgotten...

115
00:07:23,170 --> 00:07:24,790
...what happened back then?

116
00:07:28,790 --> 00:07:33,380
Kitaoka
Nakahara

117
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:31,500
Whoa, that comeback was nuts!

118
00:07:31,500 --> 00:07:33,290
They actually beat Kitaoka Middle!

119
00:07:33,290 --> 00:07:35,500
Dude, Hoshino was on fire out there!

120
00:07:35,500 --> 00:07:38,000
Guys with talent like him 
are on another level!

121
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:40,670
You can say that again! I'm totally jealous.

122
00:07:44,420 --> 00:07:48,540
Hey, Momoharu! I learned how to pull off
a between-the-legs dribble!

123
00:07:48,540 --> 00:07:50,500
See? Just watch this!

124
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:55,170
You dummy. Flashy moves like that
ain't gonna help you in a real game.

125
00:07:55,630 --> 00:08:00,670
Uh, but, hey! The fact I did it has given me confidence
that I can improve even more.

126
00:08:00,830 --> 00:08:02,540
So it makes me happy just the same!

127
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:05,380
It's been a year since I started 
extra practice with you.

128
00:08:05,380 --> 00:08:07,960
I'm honestly so glad that I 
decided to do that, Senpai!

129
00:08:08,130 --> 00:08:12,630
Where's this all coming from? I'm not gonna reward you
for sucking up to me, man.

130
00:08:12,630 --> 00:08:15,670
Uh, no! That's not what I was trying to do...

131
00:08:17,460 --> 00:08:22,130
Let's keep practicing more and more,
until we're some of the best players around!

132
00:08:29,580 --> 00:08:31,330
Okay, well, I have to go this way.

133
00:08:31,540 --> 00:08:33,290
Goodbye for today.

134
00:08:33,290 --> 00:08:35,960
Konishi... listen, I...

135
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:40,420
Oh, that reminds me. Tomorrow's Monday,
which means we don't have any team practice.

136
00:08:40,420 --> 00:08:44,830
But once class is over, I'll rush to get the gym keys
so we can practice alone!

137
00:08:46,290 --> 00:08:48,330
Let's give it our best again tomorrow!

138
00:08:53,170 --> 00:08:56,170
Sure. See ya tomorrow, dude.

139
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:59,130
Okay! I'm looking forward to it!

140
00:08:59,130 --> 00:09:00,580
Thanks for all you did today!

141
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:09,670
But that was the end of it all,
because you never came back.

142
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:13,420
Even so, Momoharu, I...

143
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:18,500
...I kept going until I got good!

144
00:09:19,420 --> 00:09:20,880
Rebound!

145
00:09:40,750 --> 00:09:42,540
Ugh, that damn idiot!

146
00:09:44,380 --> 00:09:46,330
Hell yeah! He made two in a row!

147
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,460
Konishi is on fire right now!

148
00:09:48,830 --> 00:09:51,330
That #4 doesn't have enough 
skills to stop him!

149
00:09:51,330 --> 00:09:53,790
Alright! Let's keep pushing 
into low-post to score!

150
00:09:53,790 --> 00:09:55,330
You need to sub out, Momoharu.

151
00:09:55,790 --> 00:09:58,790
If you've run out of fight,
you're only going to drag us down.

152
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:01,000
Nanao! Call a timeout!

153
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:05,130
Something weird is going on with the Captain!
Sub him out with Yashuhara for now!

154
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,130
Momoharu...

155
00:10:11,250 --> 00:10:12,540
I get it.

156
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,960
Konishi never stopped... he 
kept it up all by himself...

157
00:10:16,630 --> 00:10:19,750
That's not enough... for 
you to beat our team.

158
00:10:20,130 --> 00:10:23,380
There's no way a loser like me can compete
with dedication like that...

159
00:10:23,380 --> 00:10:24,710
Momoharu!

160
00:10:37,250 --> 00:10:38,420
Hey, Momoharu!

161
00:10:47,790 --> 00:10:51,580
Are you all right?! Do you have
a stomachache or something?

162
00:10:51,580 --> 00:10:54,130
Did you eat anything weird 
before the match started?!

163
00:10:54,330 --> 00:10:56,250
Something is really wrong with your face!

164
00:10:56,250 --> 00:10:56,830
Huh?!

165
00:10:56,830 --> 00:10:58,540
Ah, no! I mean you look pale!

166
00:10:58,750 --> 00:11:02,130
Oh, I know! This must be a side effect
from Madoka's cooking!

167
00:11:02,130 --> 00:11:04,000
That was such a killer meal, literally!

168
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,210
Uh, yeah...

169
00:11:05,210 --> 00:11:06,500
What the heck, Sora?!

170
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:09,500
Piss off, there's nothing wrong with me.

171
00:11:11,130 --> 00:11:12,920
You heard him, Nanao! No substitution!

172
00:11:14,170 --> 00:11:17,460
Dumbass! You don't call the shots around here!
If we don't do somethi-

173
00:11:17,460 --> 00:11:18,920
Don't worry!

174
00:11:18,920 --> 00:11:21,960
I know Momoharu won't lose
to anybody out on the court!

175
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,880
Are you nuts?! That's not the problem
we're talking about here!

176
00:11:26,130 --> 00:11:29,000
Okay, Chiaki! Let's hurry 
and pass the ball in!

177
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:29,920
Listen here!

178
00:11:32,330 --> 00:11:37,170
Defense! Defense! Defense!

179
00:11:37,170 --> 00:11:38,330
Nice move, Katori!

180
00:11:38,330 --> 00:11:43,580
Offense! Offense! Offense!

181
00:11:40,580 --> 00:11:42,710
Stupid shorty! This exactly why I said
we should sub him out!

182
00:11:45,250 --> 00:11:47,080
Defensive foul, #11!

183
00:11:47,380 --> 00:11:49,420
Awesome! Free-throws for us!

184
00:11:49,710 --> 00:11:53,420
I was expecting him to dodge me.
Never thought he'd shoot it straight.

185
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:55,250
I guess he just totally outwitted me.

186
00:11:55,500 --> 00:11:57,000
Oh, please, that was on purpose.

187
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:57,670
This jerk!

188
00:11:59,580 --> 00:12:03,290
Is holding the team back all I know
how to do? Seriously?

189
00:12:03,290 --> 00:12:04,380
Momoharu!

190
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:07,540
They've got two free-throws.

191
00:12:07,540 --> 00:12:09,080
We're counting on you for any rebounds!

192
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:12,830
Show me one more time, 
what it looks like to fly!

193
00:12:14,960 --> 00:12:16,380
Okay, Momoharu!

194
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:20,080
Let's hurry over to the gym.
I want to see that move of yours one more time!

195
00:12:20,830 --> 00:12:22,420
Because that kid...

196
00:12:22,420 --> 00:12:26,630
...lacks the greatest asset that anybody
can possibly have in basketball: height.

197
00:12:34,380 --> 00:12:35,630
Sweet! Another basket!

198
00:12:35,630 --> 00:12:37,630
Don't miss the second shot, Katori!

199
00:12:41,630 --> 00:12:43,630
I'm really sorry, Konishi.

200
00:12:44,380 --> 00:12:45,420
I did you wrong.

201
00:12:46,580 --> 00:12:49,460
I might not be able to compete
with your level of skill now, but...

202
00:12:50,290 --> 00:12:52,580
...I still want to get serious 
about basketball again!

203
00:12:54,830 --> 00:12:57,210
This kid taught me a real lesson.

204
00:12:58,580 --> 00:13:01,630
That no matter what happens,
you should NEVER give up!

205
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:03,880
The shot missed!

206
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:04,750
Rebound!

207
00:13:07,630 --> 00:13:08,540
Yeah! He got it!

208
00:13:08,540 --> 00:13:09,540
Nice rebound!

209
00:13:10,130 --> 00:13:11,540
Quit screwing up, dammit!

210
00:13:19,500 --> 00:13:20,290
Oh crap!

211
00:13:21,670 --> 00:13:23,630
I've been waiting for this moment!

212
00:13:24,330 --> 00:13:25,790
Awesome! He got open!

213
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:33,290
Hell yeah! A three!

214
00:13:35,250 --> 00:13:38,210
Kuzuryu
Kitasumiyoshi

215
00:13:35,330 --> 00:13:36,830
Now we have a 9-point lead!

216
00:13:36,830 --> 00:13:38,170
Keep it up, Konishi!

217
00:13:39,460 --> 00:13:41,630
I love you, Nao!

218
00:13:46,750 --> 00:13:47,790
Dammit.

219
00:13:48,710 --> 00:13:50,330
Quit staring at the ground.

220
00:13:51,380 --> 00:13:52,290
Let's go.

221
00:13:53,500 --> 00:13:54,630
Right!

222
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:57,250
But actually, you were staring
at the ground earlier yourself!

223
00:13:57,250 --> 00:13:58,330
Shut it.

224
00:14:00,920 --> 00:14:03,170
Having a 9-point lead is total chump change!

225
00:14:03,170 --> 00:14:04,670
We're gonna tie it right back up!

226
00:14:07,580 --> 00:14:09,710
"I shouldn't have quit playing back then."

227
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:13,540
"I should have started 
playing basketball earlier."

228
00:14:15,170 --> 00:14:17,790
Drowning myself in thoughts like those
is just a waste of time.

229
00:14:18,580 --> 00:14:20,500
Konishi... I am...

230
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:23,790
...going to improve alongside my teammates!

231
00:14:24,750 --> 00:14:26,540
Huh?! A double screen?!

232
00:14:29,380 --> 00:14:30,000
You brat!

233
00:14:30,250 --> 00:14:32,460
I'm not letting you sink 
another one of those!

234
00:14:33,750 --> 00:14:34,830
It bounced off his hand!

235
00:14:43,460 --> 00:14:44,420
Whoa!

236
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:46,000
What a jump!

237
00:14:47,380 --> 00:14:48,460
Senpai...!

238
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:52,290
Jumping is the one thing that I'm better at
than everybody else.

239
00:14:52,290 --> 00:14:54,210
Hell, even Jordan's got nothing on me.

240
00:14:54,210 --> 00:14:55,960
O-oh really?

241
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:58,710
He never let anything hold him back.

242
00:14:59,250 --> 00:15:01,710
Despite his shortcomings,
he was always full of confidence.

243
00:15:02,750 --> 00:15:05,250
Momoharu... I...

244
00:15:05,540 --> 00:15:08,000
...I wanted to become just like you!

245
00:15:09,330 --> 00:15:11,170
HELL YEAH!

246
00:15:11,330 --> 00:15:12,420
Whoa!

247
00:15:12,420 --> 00:15:13,630
Momoharu found his groove!

248
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,710
Hmph. That numbskull.

249
00:15:15,710 --> 00:15:17,580
All right! Time to get back in the game!

250
00:15:17,830 --> 00:15:20,380
Let Momoharu handle all of the rebounds!

251
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:28,000
Kanagawa School of Medical Science
Secondary Hospital

252
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:25,710
Are we clear? Only 10 minutes, okay?

253
00:15:26,830 --> 00:15:27,960
I'm sorry to impose.

254
00:15:28,250 --> 00:15:31,500
Honestly... if any word of 
this got to my boss, then...

255
00:15:31,500 --> 00:15:33,580
It sure can be scary to 
deal with people like him!

256
00:15:33,580 --> 00:15:35,670
Don't make it sound like you're off the hook!

257
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:38,040
Good grief.

258
00:15:40,040 --> 00:15:45,420
It's surprising. I had no idea this area
was so rich with beautiful foliage.

259
00:15:46,380 --> 00:15:48,040
Why does that come as a surprise?

260
00:15:48,040 --> 00:15:51,210
Well, I didn't expect to find 
much in the city like this.

261
00:15:51,210 --> 00:15:54,040
This hospital is quite far 
from downtown, though.

262
00:15:54,290 --> 00:15:57,000
This area is filled with nature 
spots like Ryokuchi Park.

263
00:15:57,380 --> 00:15:58,670
Oh?

264
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:02,080
This feels great!

265
00:16:04,750 --> 00:16:06,580
She looks so lively today.

266
00:16:06,580 --> 00:16:08,330
Maybe bringing her out here 
was a good idea after all.

267
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,330
Say, Ms. Yabuuchi?

268
00:16:22,710 --> 00:16:23,420
Yes?

269
00:16:23,670 --> 00:16:27,880
Do you mind... if we took a little trip
further outside the hospital?

270
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:29,000
Huh?!

271
00:16:32,290 --> 00:16:34,210
#11 has it! Don't let him cut in!

272
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:44,920
He stopped trying to cut 
in towards the basket!

273
00:16:46,330 --> 00:16:47,380
Rebound!

274
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,290
Natsume...

275
00:16:50,290 --> 00:16:51,670
Konishi! Nice rebound!

276
00:16:51,670 --> 00:16:53,670
Yasuhara, it's time! You're up!

277
00:16:53,670 --> 00:16:58,040
Huh? Wait, you know that I have 4 fouls
and just one more gets me ejected...

278
00:16:58,040 --> 00:17:00,630
3 minutes! No, even just 2 minutes is fine!

279
00:17:04,330 --> 00:17:07,420
Out of bounds! Throw-in with 
Kuzu High in possession!

280
00:17:09,250 --> 00:17:11,500
Player substitution for Kuzuryu High!

281
00:17:17,670 --> 00:17:19,080
Be careful not to foul.

282
00:17:19,080 --> 00:17:19,960
Right!

283
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:22,210
You can't go hitting or 
running into anybody, okay?

284
00:17:26,540 --> 00:17:27,500
Natsume?!

285
00:17:27,500 --> 00:17:29,790
Y-yo, Kite! Are you okay?!

286
00:17:30,630 --> 00:17:34,170
Don't freak out. I just tripped 
and had a little fall.

287
00:17:35,580 --> 00:17:36,710
This sucks!

288
00:17:37,290 --> 00:17:38,710
My leg is all cramped up.

289
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:42,580
A'ight! Just you wait, Kite!

290
00:17:43,080 --> 00:17:45,420
I swear I'm gonna turn 
this game around for us!

291
00:17:46,290 --> 00:17:50,580
Hmm, seems like #11 and #15 
have finally hit their limit.

292
00:17:50,580 --> 00:17:54,000
I doubt they have even the 
tiniest shred of stamina left.

293
00:17:54,330 --> 00:17:56,220
It's a shame since they had built good momentum,

294
00:17:56,220 --> 00:17:58,600
but now their 2 strongest are all tapped out.

295
00:17:58,600 --> 00:18:02,420
Not having a solid bench to rely on
is an unfortunate burden, indeed...

296
00:18:03,380 --> 00:18:05,580
At this point, they no longer 
have any hope of winning.

297
00:18:06,210 --> 00:18:09,080
Well, I must say they still 
did an incredible job.

298
00:18:13,210 --> 00:18:16,000
Going against man-to-man this 
late in the game is rough.

299
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:16,920
Hey Chiaki!

300
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:27,670
Offensive foul! Charging!

301
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:30,630
He anticipated the shorty's move
and was waiting to block him!

302
00:18:30,630 --> 00:18:32,290
Taro is such an amazing player!

303
00:18:33,380 --> 00:18:34,210
Nice, Taro.

304
00:18:34,210 --> 00:18:35,080
Thanks.

305
00:18:35,960 --> 00:18:37,750
Rack up another win for me.

306
00:18:37,750 --> 00:18:40,330
It's time for you to pack it 
up and go home, little boy.

307
00:18:41,540 --> 00:18:43,920
All right, boys! Let's score another one!

308
00:18:44,290 --> 00:18:45,460
Not yet!

309
00:18:45,460 --> 00:18:47,500
We're capable of doing so much more!

310
00:18:50,380 --> 00:18:51,960
Kurumatani...

311
00:19:03,250 --> 00:19:07,250
Kuzuryu
Kitasumiyoshi

312
00:19:03,630 --> 00:19:05,380
He took it right down the middle!

313
00:19:05,380 --> 00:19:07,040
Nice drive, Tachibana!

314
00:19:07,830 --> 00:19:25,880
Kitasumi! Kitasumi! Kitasumi!

315
00:19:10,210 --> 00:19:12,130
I really want them to win this...

316
00:19:12,130 --> 00:19:13,250
Um, Madoka?

317
00:19:15,290 --> 00:19:17,630
Your phone's been going 
off for a while now...

318
00:19:26,080 --> 00:19:28,540
Sorry, I got open but I couldn't sink it...

319
00:19:28,540 --> 00:19:30,420
Shake it off! Time for defense!

320
00:19:30,420 --> 00:19:31,830
Let's shut them down!

321
00:19:32,130 --> 00:19:36,130
This is the time when I should be scoring
some damn baskets... shit!

322
00:19:36,500 --> 00:19:37,630
I wanna win this!

323
00:19:38,670 --> 00:19:42,400
Oh jeez! I wouldn't have answered if I knew she was
gonna make me come out here,

324
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:44,030
I'm supposed to be ref!

325
00:19:44,030 --> 00:19:45,210
Madoka!

326
00:19:46,580 --> 00:19:47,420
Heya!

327
00:19:48,630 --> 00:19:51,630
Don't give me that! Aren't you
supposed to be at work right now?

328
00:19:52,040 --> 00:19:54,000
I'm here as part of my job!

329
00:19:54,290 --> 00:19:57,130
Apparently Kuzu High is in the middle
of a basketball game,

330
00:19:57,130 --> 00:19:59,500
so I figured you might be 
able to help us take a peek.

331
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:03,130
"Take a peek"? Why would 
you want to watch it, sis?

332
00:20:03,580 --> 00:20:05,580
I'm the one who wanted to come.

333
00:20:14,210 --> 00:20:16,790
Ms. Yuka Kurumatani...?!

334
00:20:19,540 --> 00:20:20,790
We scored again!

335
00:20:20,790 --> 00:20:22,040
They can't beat us now!

336
00:20:22,880 --> 00:20:25,920
Dammit! They're ahead of 
us now by double digits!

337
00:20:26,040 --> 00:20:30,380
They're just getting further and further ahead!
Score some damn points, you guys!

338
00:20:30,380 --> 00:20:33,130
Hey, Nao. Don't you have a 
plan or something to help?

339
00:20:42,330 --> 00:20:44,540
That last pass you made was pretty solid.

340
00:20:45,420 --> 00:20:46,290
Huh?

341
00:20:46,290 --> 00:20:49,000
Tell me, do you have any experience
being a point guard?

342
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:51,300
Well, to be honest, that 
was the only position

343
00:20:51,300 --> 00:20:55,350
I was allowed to play when I 
was younger due to my height.

344
00:20:55,350 --> 00:20:56,960
I see. That makes sense.

345
00:20:59,130 --> 00:21:00,130
I have a proposition.

346
00:21:00,540 --> 00:21:03,210
Do you think you can commit to being
our point guard for a bit?

347
00:21:03,210 --> 00:21:04,130
Huh?

348
00:21:07,040 --> 00:21:09,500
I'm going... to score us some points.

349
00:21:09,670 --> 00:21:11,250
Huh? Wait...

350
00:21:11,460 --> 00:21:13,750
You can actually shoot the ball, Chiaki?!

351
00:21:13,750 --> 00:21:15,830
Dude, how rude can you get?!

352
00:21:15,830 --> 00:21:17,380
Brace yourself for a Rock Chop later.

353
00:21:17,380 --> 00:21:20,250
Wha-?! But I've never seen you
even try to shoot a basket!

354
00:21:20,250 --> 00:21:23,640
I thought that you must be just 
as bad at shooting as Momoharu,

355
00:21:23,640 --> 00:21:25,200
since you're twins and all...

356
00:21:25,920 --> 00:21:27,630
We're twins, not clones!

357
00:21:28,630 --> 00:21:32,220
Um, so, the reason you've 
never actually tried to score

358
00:21:32,220 --> 00:21:34,470
is because you weren't playing seriously?

359
00:21:34,470 --> 00:21:37,540
Don't be stupid. I always play seriously
whenever I'm on the court.

360
00:21:38,290 --> 00:21:42,080
It's just... I can't multitask
and manage two things at once.

361
00:21:43,500 --> 00:21:46,080
I'm a pretty clumsy guy at heart, you know.

362
00:21:50,080 --> 00:21:51,040
Are you up for it?

363
00:21:51,830 --> 00:21:53,290
I'll do whatever it takes.

364
00:21:54,250 --> 00:21:57,710
No matter what... I'm not 
letting us lose this game!

365
00:22:12,830 --> 00:22:17,750
Hitori ja umaku ikanaku temo

366
00:22:18,290 --> 00:22:21,960
Kikkake nante tanjun sa

367
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:28,920
Mienai deguchi ni hikaru ga sashite

368
00:22:29,380 --> 00:22:33,080
Asu wa soko ni arunda

369
00:22:33,830 --> 00:22:39,790
Hitori nanka ja nakatta

370
00:22:39,790 --> 00:22:44,960
Kono me ni utsuru keshiki no naka ni

371
00:22:45,130 --> 00:22:51,460
Kimi ga ireba doko made datte ikeru sa

372
00:22:51,460 --> 00:22:56,330
Kitto genkai nante nainda

373
00:22:56,330 --> 00:23:01,500
Kimi to ireba tsuyoku narunda

374
00:23:01,710 --> 00:23:08,580
Nando demo tachiagatte susunde ikou

375
00:23:08,710 --> 00:23:16,630
Oh oh oh, oh oh oh, oh oh oh,

376
00:23:16,630 --> 00:23:19,580
Saigo no ichibyou made

377
00:23:19,790 --> 00:23:22,420
Akiramenaide busukatte

378
00:23:22,420 --> 00:23:29,500
Kono michi no saki wa 
kanarazu kagayaiteru kara

379
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:35,420
Ahiru no Sora
Next Time: Last Play

380
00:23:31,750 --> 00:23:34,250
Next episode: "Last Play."

